  description: "All other \"Ancient Warriors\" monsters you control cannot be destroyed
    by battle. You can only use each of the following effects of \"Ancient Warriors
    - Fearsome Zhang Yuan\" once per turn.\r\n\u25CF At the start of the Damage Step,
    when your \"Ancient Warriors\" monster battles an opponent's face-up monster:
    You can Special Summon this card from your hand, and if you do, that opponent's
    monster loses 1000 ATK.\r\n\u25CF If a card(s) your opponent controls is destroyed
    by battle or card effect: You can target 1 card your opponent controls; destroy
    it."
